      "refersTo": "nav",
      "description": "The plum navigation field with an active lavender underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Play</button><button type=\"button\">Match history</button><button type=\"button\">Leaderboard</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:31px;height:80px;background:var(--plum,#29264b);padding:0 24px}.ds-nav button{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;background:none;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;color:#cdc8de;padding:4px 0 0;font-weight:550;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav button.ds-nav-current{color:#fff;border-bottom-color:#c6b7ed}.ds-nav button:hover{color:#fff}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#a48bce);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:900px){.ds-nav{height:72px;gap:23px}}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-nav{height:49px;gap:28px;padding:0 20px}.ds-nav button{font-size:11px;padding:0}}"
